entries.content:
Crime in NeoCity: Lots in NeoCity; The Obsidian Syndicate (most dangerous); Techno-Syndicate (powerful; specialize in cybercrime, hacking, illegal tech trading); Cybersmugglers Guild (network of smugglers; traffic illegal cyber-enhancements, hacking tools, contraband tech);
Yakuza (Japanese organized crime syndicate; operates in smuggling, gambling, and protection rackets);
The Triads (Chinese criminal organization; focus on drug trafficking, human smuggling, and black market tech);
The Mafia (involved in arms trafficking, extortion, and organized crime);
The Vory V Zakone (Russian crime syndicate; specializes in cybercrime, weapons smuggling, and assassination);
The Black Lodge (secretive magical society involved in high-profile assassinations and occult activities);
The Seoulpa Rings (Korean criminal groups specializing in tech theft, data piracy, and underground cybernetics).
